# MaintainU Mobile App - System Architecture & Workflow

## Executive Summary

MaintainU is a comprehensive **B2B maintenance service marketplace** (similar to Urban Company but for industrial clients) consisting of **three interconnected mobile applications** that streamline the entire workflow from service request to completion and billing.

> [!TIP]
> **Architecture inspired by Urban Company** - Incorporating proven patterns: escrow payments, real-time tracking, rating-based allocation, and microservices architecture.

### High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Apps["📱 Mobile Apps"]
        CA[🏭 Company App]
        AA[👔 Admin App]
        TA[🔧 Technician App]
    end
    
    subgraph Gateway["🚪 API Layer"]
        AG[API Gateway + Load Balancer]
    end
    
    subgraph Core["⚙️ Core Services"]
        AUTH[Auth Service]
        BOOK[Booking Service]
        DISP[Dispatch Engine]
        TEAM[Team Service]
        TRACK[Tracking Service]
        PAY[Payment Service]
        NOTIF[Notification Service]
        RATE[Rating Service]
        ADMIN[Admin Service]
    end
    
    subgraph External["🔌 External Services"]
        SMS[SMS Gateway]
        FCM[Push Notifications]
        MAPS[Google Maps]
        PG[Payment Gateway]
        S3[Cloud Storage]
        EMAIL[Email Service]
    end
    
    subgraph Data["💾 Data Layer"]
        PG_DB[(PostgreSQL)]
        REDIS[(Redis Cache)]
        ELASTIC[(Elasticsearch)]
    end
    
    CA --> AG
    AA --> AG
    TA --> AG
    
    AG --> AUTH
    AG --> BOOK
    AG --> DISP
    AG --> TEAM
    AG --> TRACK
    AG --> PAY
    AG --> RATE
    
    AUTH --> SMS
    NOTIF --> FCM
    TRACK --> MAPS
    PAY --> PG
    BOOK --> EMAIL
    
    Core --> PG_DB
    Core --> REDIS
    ADMIN --> ELASTIC
```

### Platform Overview

| Side | App | Users | Primary Function |
|------|-----|-------|------------------|
| **Demand** | Company App | Industry clients | Request services, track work, pay invoices |
| **Supply** | Technician App | Service professionals | Accept jobs, navigate, complete work |
| **Control** | Admin App | MaintainU staff | Manage teams, dispatch, billing, oversight |

---

## 1. System Modules Overview

### 1.1 Company User App (Client Portal)
**Purpose**: For companies needing maintenance/assembly services

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Service Requests | Create detailed maintenance/assembly requests |
| Request Tracking | Monitor request status in real-time |
| Notifications | Receive updates on work progress |
| Invoice Management | View and download invoices via email |
| Signature Verification | Supervisor signs on completion |

---

### 1.2 Admin App (Control Center)
**Purpose**: Central management hub for all operations

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Request Management | View and process incoming requests |
| Technician Registry | Manage registered technicians and skills |
| **Master Team Formation** | Create master team of technicians for a company/job |
| **Daily Selection** | Choose technicians to work each day based on availability |
| **Attendance Management** | Track daily attendance and work hours |
| **Substitute Handling** | Approve/reject substitute requests with salary implications |
| **Salary Calculation** | Compute technician payments based on attendance |
| Communication Hub | Send assignments and receive responses |
| Work Monitoring | Track ongoing job statuses |
| Billing & Invoicing | Generate and send invoices/reports |
| Lead Assignment | Designate team lead (confidential) |

---

### 1.3 Technician App (Field Operations)
**Purpose**: For field technicians to receive and execute work

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Assignment Notifications | Receive job assignments |
| Response System | Accept/decline team participation |
| Location & Navigation | View job location via maps integration |
| Contact Access | Access company spokesperson details |
| Status Updates | Report work progress |
| Signature Collection | Collect supervisor signature (lead only) |

---

## 1.4 Authentication & Registration System

> [!IMPORTANT]
> All users authenticate via **phone number with OTP** for simplicity - no passwords required. This is ideal for non-tech-savvy users who may find password management difficult.

### Phone-Based Authentication Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant SMS as SMS Gateway
    
    U->>App: Enter Phone Number
    App->>API: POST /auth/send-otp
    API->>SMS: Send OTP
    SMS->>U: SMS with 6-digit OTP
    
    U->>App: Enter OTP
    App->>API: POST /auth/verify-otp
    API->>API: Validate OTP
    
    alt New User
        API->>App: Registration Required
        App->>U: Show Registration Form
    else Existing User
        API->>App: JWT Token + User Data
        App->>U: Navigate to Dashboard
    end
```

---

### 1.4.1 Company User Registration

| Field | Type | Required |
|-------|------|----------|
| Phone Number | Auto-filled | ✅ |
| Company Name | Text | ✅ |
| Industry Type | Dropdown | ✅ |
| Company Address | Text + Map Pin | ✅ |
| GST Number | Text | Optional |
| Company Email | Email | ✅ |
| Spokesperson Name | Text | ✅ |
| Spokesperson Phone | Phone | ✅ |
| Spokesperson Email | Email | Optional |

**Flow**: Simple form → Submit → Account Active Immediately

