### 1.4.3 Technician Registration (Detailed)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Technicians require **admin approval** before their account becomes active. They must submit documents and await verification.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Registration["📝 Technician Registration"]
        R1[Enter Phone & OTP]
        R2[Fill Personal Details]
        R3[Upload Documents]
        R4[Submit for Review]
    end
    
    subgraph Approval["👔 Admin Approval"]
        A1[Admin Reviews Application]
        A2{Decision}
        A3[Approve - Account Active]
        A4[Reject - Notify Technician]
    end
    
    R1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4 --> A1 --> A2
    A2 -->|Approve| A3
    A2 -->|Reject| A4
```

