### Admin Approval Workflow for Technicians

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Technician
    participant App as Tech App
    participant API as Backend
    participant Admin as Admin App
    
    T->>App: Complete Registration Form
    T->>App: Upload All Documents
    T->>App: Submit Application
    
    App->>API: POST /technicians/register
    API->>API: Save as PENDING status
    API->>Admin: Push: New Technician Application
    
    Admin->>Admin: View Application Details
    Admin->>Admin: Review Documents
    Admin->>Admin: Verify Credentials
    
    alt Approve
        Admin->>API: PUT /technicians/{id}/approve
        API->>API: Status = ACTIVE
        API->>T: Push: Welcome! Account Approved
        T->>App: Can now login & receive jobs
    else Reject
        Admin->>API: PUT /technicians/{id}/reject
        Admin->>API: Include rejection reason
        API->>T: Push: Application Rejected
        API->>T: SMS: Rejection reason + reapply info
    end
```

### Technician Application Review Screen (Admin)

| Section | Details Shown |
|---------|---------------|
| **Header** | Photo, Name, Phone, Applied Date, Status Badge |
| **Personal** | Age, Address, Emergency Contact |
| **Skills** | Primary skill highlighted, Secondary skills tags |
| **Experience** | Years, Previous employer, Certifications |
| **Documents** | Expandable gallery view for each document |
| **Bank** | Masked account details |
| **Actions** | Large Approve (Green) / Reject (Red) buttons |
| **Reject Modal** | Reason dropdown + Custom text + Confirm |

