## 2. Complete Workflow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 🏭 Company
    participant A as 👔 Admin
    participant T as 🔧 Technicians
    
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over C,A: Phase 1: Request Creation
        C->>A: Submit Service Request
        A->>A: Review & Categorize Request
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over A,T: Phase 2: Master Team Formation
        A->>A: Select Relevant Technicians for Master Team
        A->>T: Send Master Team Invitations
        T->>A: Respond (Accept/Decline)
        A->>A: Finalize Master Team (Replace if needed)
        A->>A: Assign Team Lead (Confidential)
    end
    
    rect rgb(230, 250, 240)
        Note over A,T: Phase 3: Daily Work Cycle (Repeats for Multi-Day Jobs)
        A->>T: Request daily availability
        T->>A: Confirm availability for the day
        A->>A: Select technicians for the day's work
        A->>T: Send daily work assignments + Location
        T->>T: Navigate to Site
        T->>A: Check-in (Work Started)
        T->>A: Work In-Progress Updates
        T->>A: Check-out (Day's Work Completed)
        A->>A: Record Daily Attendance
        Note right of A: Cycle repeats daily until job complete
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over T,A: Phase 4: Substitute Handling (if needed any day)
        T->>A: Request Substitute (with reason)
        A->>A: Review substitute request
        A->>T: Approve/Reject substitute
        Note right of A: If approved, salary deducted from original
    end
    
    rect rgb(200, 230, 255)
        Note over A,C: Phase 5: Completion Verification
        A->>C: Enquire about work status
        C->>A: Confirm work is complete / needs more days
        alt Work Complete
            A->>A: Mark job as ready for sign-off
        else More Days Needed
            A->>A: Continue daily work cycle
        end
    end
    
    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over C,T: Phase 6: Final Sign-off
        T->>C: Lead Shows Signature Canvas
        C->>T: Supervisor Signs
        T->>A: Auto-upload Signature
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 255, 230)
        Note over A,C: Phase 7: Salary & Billing
        A->>A: Calculate Salary based on Attendance
        A->>T: Process Payment for Work
        A->>C: Send Invoice via Email
        A->>C: Send Work Reports via Email
        C->>C: App Notification about Documents
    end
```

