## 2.0 Job Duration Model

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Jobs in MaintainU can vary from **1 day to several weeks**. The admin determines when a job is complete after checking with the company.

### Single-Day vs Multi-Day Jobs

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph SingleDay["📅 Single-Day Job"]
        S1[Morning: Team dispatched]
        S2[Day: Work performed]
        S3[Evening: Signature & completion]
    end
    
    subgraph MultiDay["📆 Multi-Day Job (1 week to months)"]
        M1[Day 1: Team dispatched]
        M2[Daily: Work cycle repeats]
        M3[Each day: Attendance tracked]
        M4[Admin checks: Is work complete?]
        M5{Company confirms completion?}
        M6[Final day: Signature & completion]
    end
    
    S1 --> S2 --> S3
    M1 --> M2 --> M3 --> M4 --> M5
    M5 -->|No, continue| M2
    M5 -->|Yes, done| M6
```

### Daily Work Cycle (for Multi-Day Jobs)

| Time | Activity | Who |
|------|----------|-----|
| **Morning** | Admin selects today's team from Master Team | Admin |
| **Morning** | Selected technicians receive notification | Technicians |
| **Start** | Technicians check-in at site | Technicians |
| **During** | Work updates (optional) | Technicians |
| **End** | Technicians check-out | Technicians |
| **Evening** | Admin records attendance | Admin |
| **Next Day** | Cycle repeats if work not complete | - |

### Completion Determination Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant C as Company
    participant Sys as System
    
    Note over A,Sys: After each day or periodically
    
    A->>C: Is the work complete?
    
    alt Work Still in Progress
        C->>A: No, need more days
        A->>Sys: Continue job, schedule next day
        Note over A,Sys: Daily cycle continues
    else Work Finished
        C->>A: Yes, work is complete
        A->>Sys: Mark job ready for final sign-off
        A->>A: Trigger signature collection
    end
```

---

## 2.1 Master Team, Daily Selection & Attendance Workflow

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is the core workforce management system that handles team composition, daily work allocation, attendance tracking, and substitute management.

### Concept Overview

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Phase1["🏗️ Master Team Creation (One-time per Job)"]
        MT1[Admin reviews job requirements]
        MT2[Admin selects qualified technicians]
        MT3[Technicians accept/decline]
        MT4[Master Team finalized]
        MT5[Lead assigned - confidential]
    end
    
    subgraph Phase2["📅 Daily Selection (Each Work Day)"]
        DS1[Admin checks availability]
        DS2[Technicians confirm for the day]
        DS3[Admin selects from available pool]
        DS4[Daily team formed]
    end
    
    subgraph Phase3["📋 Attendance & Work"]
        AT1[Technicians check-in]
        AT2[Work performed]
        AT3[Technicians check-out]
        AT4[Attendance recorded]
    end
    
    MT1 --> MT2 --> MT3 --> MT4 --> MT5
    MT5 --> DS1
    DS1 --> DS2 --> DS3 --> DS4
    DS4 --> AT1 --> AT2 --> AT3 --> AT4
```

---

### Master Team vs Daily Team

| Aspect | Master Team | Daily Team |
|--------|-------------|------------|
| **Created** | Once per job/project | Each work day |
| **Contains** | All approved technicians for the job | Subset working on a specific day |
| **Size** | Larger pool (e.g., 10-15) | Smaller active group (e.g., 5-6) |
| **Selection** | Based on skills & acceptance | Based on availability & admin choice |
| **Attendance** | Not tracked at this level | Tracked daily with check-in/out |

---

### Daily Selection Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant MT as Master Team Members
    participant DT as Selected Daily Team
    
    Note over A,MT: Start of Each Work Day
    
    A->>MT: Request availability for [Date]
    MT->>A: [Available] / [Not Available]
    
    A->>A: Review available technicians
    A->>A: Select team for the day
    
    A->>DT: You are selected to work today
    A->>DT: Send location & contact details
    
    DT->>A: Acknowledge assignment
```

