## 2.2 Substitute Management System

### Substitute Workflow Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Request["📨 Substitute Request"]
        S1[Master team member unavailable]
        S2[Request substitute with reason]
        S3[Nominate replacement technician]
    end
    
    subgraph Admin["👔 Admin Decision"]
        A1{Review Request}
        A2[Approve Substitute]
        A3[Reject Request]
    end
    
    subgraph Outcome["📊 Outcome"]
        O1["✅ Substitute works under original's name"]
        O2["💰 Original's salary deducted for the day"]
        O3["📝 Record kept: who actually worked"]
        O4["❌ Original must work or marked absent"]
        O5["📝 Request recorded for reference"]
    end
    
    S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> A1
    A1 -->|Approve| A2 --> O1 --> O2 --> O3
    A1 -->|Reject| A3 --> O4 --> O5
```

### Substitute Scenarios

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant OT as Original Technician
    participant ST as Substitute Technician
    participant A as Admin
    participant Sys as System
    
    Note over OT,Sys: Scenario: Substitute Request Flow
    
    OT->>A: Request substitute for [Date]
    OT->>A: Reason: [Medical/Personal/Emergency]
    OT->>A: Suggested Substitute: [Name]
    
    A->>A: Review request & substitute
    
    alt Admin Approves
        A->>OT: Substitute approved
        A->>ST: You are substituting for [Original]
        ST->>Sys: Works & checks in
        Sys->>Sys: Attendance marked for Original
        Sys->>Sys: Substitute column shows: [Substitute Name]
        A->>A: Review at end of day
        A->>Sys: Confirm salary deduction for Original
        Sys->>Sys: Original's salary -= Day's pay
        Sys->>Sys: Substitute receives payment separately
    else Admin Rejects
        A->>OT: Substitute rejected
        A->>OT: You must work or be marked absent
        Sys->>Sys: Store rejection record
    end
```

### Attendance Record Structure

| Field | Description | Example |
|-------|-------------|---------|
| **Date** | Work date | 2026-01-11 |
| **Technician** | Master team member name | John Smith |
| **Status** | Present/Absent/Substitute | Substitute |
| **Substitute** | Who actually worked (if any) | Mike Johnson |
| **Check-in** | Arrival time | 09:00 AM |
| **Check-out** | Departure time | 06:00 PM |
| **Hours** | Total work hours | 8 |
| **Substitute Approved** | Admin decision | Yes |
| **Salary Deducted** | From original technician | Yes |
| **Notes** | Additional info | Medical leave |

