## 2.3 Salary Calculation System

### Salary Calculation Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Input["📥 Input Data"]
        I1[Attendance Records]
        I2[Daily Rate per Technician]
        I3[Substitute Approvals]
        I4[Work Hours]
    end
    
    subgraph Calculation["🧮 Calculation"]
        C1[Count working days]
        C2[Deduct substitute days]
        C3[Apply hourly adjustments]
        C4[Calculate net salary]
    end
    
    subgraph Output["📤 Output"]
        O1[Salary Statement]
        O2[Payment Processing]
    end
    
    I1 --> C1
    I2 --> C1
    I3 --> C2
    I4 --> C3
    C1 --> C2 --> C3 --> C4 --> O1 --> O2
```

### Salary Calculation Formula

```
For each technician:

Total Days Worked = Days Present + Days with Substitute (where substitute was them)
Days Deducted = Days they were substituted (if approved)

Net Working Days = Total Days Worked - Days Deducted
Base Salary = Daily Rate × Net Working Days

Adjustments:
  + Overtime (if applicable)
  - Deductions (approved substitutes)
  
Final Salary = Base Salary + Adjustments
```

### Admin Salary Review Dashboard

| Technician | Working Days | Substituted Days | Substitute For Others | Net Days | Daily Rate | Gross | Deductions | Net Salary |
|------------|--------------|------------------|----------------------|----------|------------|-------|------------|------------|
| John S. | 20 | 2 (approved) | 0 | 18 | ₹1000 | ₹20,000 | ₹2,000 | ₹18,000 |
| Mike J. | 22 | 0 | 2 | 22 | ₹1000 | ₹22,000 | ₹0 | ₹22,000 |
| Sarah K. | 19 | 1 (rejected) | 1 | 19 | ₹1200 | ₹24,000 | ₹0 | ₹24,000 |

