## 5. Work Status Tracking Solutions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Challenge**: Many industrial sites prohibit mobile phone usage for safety/security reasons.

### 5.1 Multi-Modal Status Tracking Options

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Primary["📱 Primary - Mobile App"]
        P1[Photo Evidence]
        P2[In-App Status Updates]
        P3[GPS Check-in]
    end
    
    subgraph Alternative["🔧 Alternative Methods"]
        A1[Site Supervisor Verification]
        A2[QR Code Check-in]
        A3[Designated Reporting Zones]
        A4[IoT Sensors]
        A5[Smartwatch Integration]
    end
    
    subgraph Admin["👔 Admin Dashboard"]
        AD[Real-time Status Board]
    end
    
    Primary --> AD
    Alternative --> AD
```

### 5.2 Recommended Solutions

#### Option 1: **Site Supervisor Verification System** ⭐ (Recommended)

The company's site supervisor can update work status through the Company User app.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Technician Team
    participant S as Site Supervisor
    participant CA as Company App
    participant A as Admin
    
    T->>S: Reports "Work Started"
    S->>CA: Confirms via Company App
    CA->>A: Status Update: Started
    
    T->>S: Reports "In Progress" + Details
    S->>CA: Confirms via Company App
    CA->>A: Status Update: In Progress
    
    T->>S: Reports "Completed"
    S->>CA: Signs on Signature Canvas
    CA->>A: Status Update: Completed + Signature
```

**Implementation**:
- Add "Verify Work Status" feature in Company User App
- Supervisor receives push notification when team arrives
- Supervisor confirms milestones through the app
- Maintains accountability chain

---

#### Option 2: **QR Code Based Check-in System**

Place QR codes at designated areas within the facility.

| Location | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| Entry Gate | Work Start Confirmation |
| Work Area | In-Progress Check-in |
| Supervisor Office | Completion Sign-off |

**How it works**:
1. Lead technician scans QR code at entry (when phones are briefly allowed)
2. Supervisor receives confirmation
3. Phone is secured in locker
4. At completion, lead retrieves phone and scans completion QR

---

#### Option 3: **Designated Phone Zones**

Create a "reporting zone" near the work area where phones are permitted.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Facility
        RZ[📱 Reporting Zone]
        WA[🚫 Work Area - No Phones]
    end
    
    T[Technician] -.->|Check-in| RZ
    T -->|Work| WA
    T -.->|Update Status| RZ
    RZ -->|Status| Admin
```

---

#### Option 4: **Smartwatch Integration** (Premium)

For high-security facilities, provide company smartwatches.

| Feature | Capability |
|---------|------------|
| Simple Status Buttons | Start / In Progress / Complete |
| Voice Notes | Brief work updates |
| GPS Tracking | Verify on-site presence |
| Minimal Distraction | No camera, limited functions |

---

#### Option 5: **IoT Sensor Integration** (Enterprise)

For recurring service contracts at the same location.

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Facility
        B1[Bluetooth Beacon - Entry]
        B2[Bluetooth Beacon - Work Area]
        B3[Bluetooth Beacon - Exit]
    end
    
    subgraph Backend
        LS[Location Service]
        NS[Notification Service]
    end
    
    B1 --> LS
    B2 --> LS
    B3 --> LS
    
    LS --> NS
    NS -->|Push| Admin
```

---

### 5.3 Hybrid Approach (Best Practice)

Implement a **tiered system** based on client requirements:

| Tier | Method | Use Case |
|------|--------|----------|
| Standard | Mobile App with Photo Evidence | Regular facilities |
| Restricted | Site Supervisor Verification | No-phone facilities |
| High Security | QR + Supervisor + Smartwatch | Sensitive installations |

---

## 6. Signature Collection Workflow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Lead Technician
    participant App as Technician App
    participant S as Site Supervisor
    participant Cloud as Cloud Storage
    participant Admin as Admin
    
    Note over L,Admin: Work Completion Flow
    
    L->>App: Opens Signature Canvas
    L->>S: Hands device to Supervisor
    
    S->>App: Views Work Summary
    S->>App: Draws Signature
    S->>App: Enters Name & Designation
    S->>App: Taps "Confirm"
    
    App->>Cloud: Upload Signature Image
    App->>Admin: Push: Job Completed
    Admin->>Admin: Views Signature + Completion
    
    Note over Admin: Verifies & Proceeds to Billing
```

### Signature Canvas Features
- Smooth drawing experience
- Clear/Redo option
- Supervisor name input
- Designation field
- Timestamp overlay
- Geo-location stamp
- Cannot be edited after submission

