## 9. Technology Stack Recommendation

### 9.1 Frontend (Mobile Apps)

| Option | Pros | Cons |
|--------|------|------|
| **React Native** ⭐ | Single codebase, Large community, Good performance | Might need native modules |
| **Flutter** | Great UI, Fast development, Good performance | Dart learning curve |
| **Native (Kotlin/Swift)** | Best performance, Platform-specific UX | 2x development effort |

**Recommendation**: **React Native** with Expo for rapid development

### 9.2 Backend

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|------------|
| **API Framework** | Node.js with Express/NestJS or Python with FastAPI |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (primary) + Redis (caching) |
| **Authentication** | JWT with refresh tokens |
| **File Storage** | AWS S3 or Google Cloud Storage |
| **Push Notifications** | Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) |
| **Email Service** | SendGrid or AWS SES |
| **Maps Integration** | Google Maps SDK |
| **Hosting** | AWS / Google Cloud / Azure |

### 9.3 Additional Tools

| Purpose | Tool |
|---------|------|
| API Documentation | Swagger/OpenAPI |
| Real-time Updates | WebSockets or Firebase Realtime DB |
| PDF Generation | Puppeteer or PDFKit |
| Analytics | Firebase Analytics / Mixpanel |
| Error Tracking | Sentry |

---

## 10. Security Considerations

### 10.1 Authentication & Authorization

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Security Layers
        L1[Role-Based Access Control]
        L2[JWT Token Authentication]
        L3[API Rate Limiting]
        L4[Data Encryption]
        L5[Secure File Storage]
    end
    
    subgraph Roles
        R1[COMPANY_USER]
        R2[ADMIN]
        R3[TECHNICIAN]
    end
    
    R1 --> L1
    R2 --> L1
    R3 --> L1
```

### 10.2 Security Measures

| Area | Implementation |
|------|----------------|
| Data at Rest | AES-256 encryption |
| Data in Transit | TLS 1.3 |
| Passwords | bcrypt with salt |
| Tokens | JWT with short expiry + refresh |
| APIs | Rate limiting, Input validation |
| Files | Signed URLs with expiry |
| Logs | Audit trail for sensitive actions |

